exports[`ReferralPanel · english copy golden master > after copying 1`] = `
[
  "/// REF",
  "REFERRAL DESK",
  "8% on deposits made through your link here, plus 2% for life on wallets you bring to Tosh · paid out when the project launches",
  "YOUR REFERRAL LINK",
  "http://localhost:3000/?ref=0x35b232E26a275f62E594e010624aEA0c46b7874a",
  "copied",
  "//",
  "How the two legs bind",
  "The first link a wallet arrives on through this project binds it to you here, for 8%. If it is also the first Tosh link that wallet ever used, you keep 2% of everything it deposits anywhere, for life. Both bindings are permanent, and self-referral is ignored by the factory.",
  "A leg that does not bind shows no error: the deposit still succeeds, and the share goes to whoever bound that wallet first, or to the platform at launch if nobody did. Your link binds only once your own PoG attestation is on file; the factory retries on every deposit, so a link already in circulation starts paying from then on.",
  "→",
  "Commission across every project",
]
`;

